{"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/planarity\/planarembedding"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"title":"PlanarEmbedding","roleHeading":"Structure","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PlanarEmbedding.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding.swift#L67"},"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Planarity"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"identifier"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"A planar embedding of a graph: a rotation system, the clockwise order of the edges around each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex, over every edge position (NetworkX’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"PlanarEmbedding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", LEMON’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"PlanarEmbedding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OGDF’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"CombinatorialEmbedding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). Its faces satisfy Euler’s formula, n − m + f = 2, in every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"connected component with an edge.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseIncidentEdges","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighborIndices","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighbors","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/Faces-swift.struct"],"title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faceCount","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faces-swift.property"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(checked:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighborIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(checked:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/face(from:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/rightFace(from:alongEdgeAt:)"],"title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","text":"Graph","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A self-loop appears twice in its vertex’s order, its two ends adjacent, enclosing a face of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"length 1. Parallel copies sit side by side, each consecutive pair enclosing a face of length 2.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each clockwise order starts at the first edge of ","type":"text"},{"code":"incidentEdges(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Faces.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" The face after the half-edge from u along edge e to w continues with the half-edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before e in the clockwise order at w (NetworkX’s "},{"code":"next_face_half_edge","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a face lies to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right of each of its half-edges. Faces are counted per connected component, and an isolated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex has none: two disjoint triangles have four faces."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The embedding keeps the graph it was made from (copy-on-write, so O(1)); mutating the graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"afterwards does not change it. When a graph has several embeddings, which one is returned is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not specified, but it depends only on the graph’s rows: graphs with the same vertices, the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"edge positions and the same incidence order get the same embedding."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Planarity/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity/PlanarEmbedding/clockwiseNeighbors(checked:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(checked:)","kind":"symbol","title":"clockwiseNeighbors(checked:)","abstract":[{"code":"clockwiseNeighbors(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", throwing instead of trapping when ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertex","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is not a vertex of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the graph.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/planarity\/planarembedding\/clockwiseneighbors(checked:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwiseNeighbors","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"checked","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols14VertexNotFoundV","text":"VertexNotFound","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV","text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">.","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV18ClockwiseNeighborsV","text":"ClockwiseNeighbors","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity":{"role":"collection","title":"Planarity","url":"\/documentation\/planarity","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://